{
  "answer": "Based on the 2024 Guinness World Records information, the Swedish swimmer who equaled the record for the most consecutive long course World Championship swimming gold medals in the same event is **Sarah Sjöström** (she achieved six consecutive medals in the women's 50 metres butterfly in 2015, 2017, 2019, 2022, 2023, and 2024).\n\nHowever, the provided sources do not state her hometown.",
